<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">Basi Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana a Poole wu a nsomo kundaa basi Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="mt2">MUKAANA A POOLE WU A NSOMO KUNDAA BASI</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKE</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu me mukaana wu a nsomo wu ósono Poole kundaa bakriste ba báli ku Tesalonike. Poole áli agyene oko ya áluo bo Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Yiisu-Kriste (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-10">Big 17.1-10</ref></char>). Baara baba oko bánama nzili a Kriste. Lo ŋa mbihi a mana matala, ndaama ba-Dzwife ba báli oko bátihi baara mpaala bo batemene a Poole nsumu ya ndughu a nde. Bakriste básweghe Poole ya bandughu ba nde. Mu mpyibi, bo bápala a bo ku mbala a bvulu ya Poole ágyene ku Bere ya bandughu ba nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋa mbihi a bamvulu buolo, Poole ágweghe Timote mu oyimono bu óli bakriste baba ku Tesalonike. Timote bu agyene ya bu ayabvughuru, nde ályele kundaa Poole ti bo báli nkini mu okanama nzili a Kriste, lo baara bana ŋa kara li bo bákabihi osala buulu babagha bi babuŋunu manyuru ma bo. Bo bákalyele ti edzi-dzighi Yiisu sa ayabvughuru, ya kala ti bo basala, esala e bo sa ekala kii bwunu. Baara babake ka báli a edzuunu o, mu kuulu balagha mu badzighi ba bo ya bandughu ba bo báakpi, ya Yiisu ka ákayabvughuru o. Me mu obo Poole ásono bo mukaana mu ogwa bo mpama ya mu osuo bo bunu obvughuru o Yiisu ookala, ya nde nki ndagha aagyighili kundaa babo ba baakasa kana mu nde. Mu obo, bo bákughu okasa emiini ti bo sa bakala matala mwohono ya Mfumu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakaba mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mboro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1.1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Bunu-abo basi Tesalonike baasi kana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1.2–3.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Bumweẽ bu buukagwa Nzaami esee (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Emiini mu obvughuru o Yiisu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13–5.11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Luo ya mboro yi masini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-28">5.12-28</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Me Poole, emõ ya Silibvĩ ya Timote, lisono mukaana wu kundaa libwunu li Nzaami li lili mu bvulu lili Tesalonike, libwunu li Nzaami Taara ya lili Mfumu Yiisu Kriste: Nyaã bwehe ya edzuunu bikala ya be!<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bumweẽ ya kana li basi Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Mu nswe matala, bihi liikabvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami mu be bwohono. Ya bihi liikasamana mu be. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ŋa mihi mi Nzaami Taara a bihi, bihi liikalibili mweẽ mu bigyighili bi kana li be, bisala bi liikasala be mu dzyi, ya mukama a be mu emiini mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, be ba ookadzyi Nzaami, bihi lisoolo ti Nzaami ásuolo be mu okala baba ndaa nde. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Mu kuulu, ka yini a mu mbiili bihi líluo be Nsia yi Mbwe o, lo si mu lileene, mu libaha li Mufulu a Ngili ya mu kana. Be lisoolo bu líli bihi ŋa kara li be, mu nkooro a bubwe bu be.<verse eid="1TH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ya beme si liinama efaana e bihi ya kii Mfumu, bu liigyagha Ndagha kunsa mpara yi alagha, mu esee ki ookagwa Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Mu obo, be ayi bifaana kundaa baara bwohono ba baakasa kana ba bali ku bitsulu bi mansie bibi Masedwane ya Akayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Mu kuulu, Ndagha a Mfumu yiifi kundaa be ya baagyughu yo tee ku Masedwane ya ku Akayi. Nsia a kana li be mu Nzaami yiitsaŋama mu bibini byehene ya bihi ka lifirisyili a nzala a obili mu lo o. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Mu kuulu baara bwohono bali mu okabulubili mu mbwa-mbwana yi liibwana a be bihi ya bu liityeghe be banzaami baba bityeghe mbihi mu osalala Nzaami wu a mweẽ ya wu a ngaŋma, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ya mu okebe Mwana a nde wu aafa ku mayulu, Yiisu wu aasiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi. Me mwana munde aakwulu bihi-a-be mu masyeme ma Nzaami ma maagya.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Mu obo, bandughu ba me mu kana, be beme ligyighili osoolo ti ogya o bihi kundaa be ka ooli ku obwunu o. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ŋa mbihi a ŋa bámwehẽ bihi kimini ya ŋa límono bihi mpara ku bvulu lili Filipe, ti bwunu a bu lisoolo be, bihi liibagha bukyini bu bukughu mu Nzaami a bihi mu oluo be Nsia yi Mbwe a nde ŋa kara li mamvulu. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mpama yi líkagwa bihi baara ka yísiŋi mu epfwumu o, ka yísiŋi mu osuŋumu o, bwunu we mu mayele ma mabi. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Lo buulu me Nzaami aagyeele bihi ya aagwi bihi Nsia yi Mbwe, bihi ka liikabili mu ogwa baara esee o, lo mu ogwa Nzaami wu aakagyeele mikolo mi baara esee.<verse eid="1TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Mu kuulu, be lisoolo ti kaala bihi nkini liisalala mbiili yi mbwe mu opele baara o. Kaala bihi nkini liisuo be bitsimi bibi ntono a nzi o. Nzaami li mpughulu mu mandagha mamo. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Bihi ka liisagha masyighi ma maafa kundaa baara o, ngu okala kundaa be, bwunu we kundaa baara bakimi. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Bu lili bihi bantumu ba Kriste, bihi liikaakwighi be mu ogwa bihi budziri, lo bihi liili ti anga bike-bike ŋa kara li be. Ti anga ngughu wu aakatsyaha baana ba nde, <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />mu dzyi li líli a bihi mu be, bihi ka lídzyi o ti bihi líluo be yini a Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Nzaami, lo si ogwa bumweẽ bu bihi bameme mu be, mu kuulu be lili baara baba ntala kundaa bihi.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Bandughu mu kana, be lilibili mweẽ mu esala e bihi ya mu mpara yi liimono bihi. Mu kuulu, bihi liikabulutsala be Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Nzaami, mu okasala si mpyibi ya mwi, mu onyaã ogwa leme kundaa nswe mbwuru ŋa kara li be. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Be lili bampughulu, ya Nzaami si li mpughulu, ti ŋa nkulu a be ba liikasa kana, bihi liili a nzya-nzyara yi bungili, yi bunsumu ya yi baagwene a yi baasyeme. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Be lisoolo si ti bihi líili kundaa nswe mbwuru mu be ti bu ookakala taara ya baana ba nde. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Bihi lili mu okagwa be mpama, bukyini ya lili mu okasa be enkwili mu okala a nzya-nzyara yi aakagwa Nzaami budziri, nde wu áti be mbili mu Emfumu ya mu nsia a nde.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Me mu obo, bihi si liikabvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami matala mwohono mu kuulu be bu ligyagha ndagha a Nzaami yi liiluo bihi be, be liikihi yo, ka ti anga ndagha a mbwuru o, lo nkara a bwunu a bu yili yo ndagha a Nzaami yi a ngaŋma, yili mu okabulusala mu be ba liikasa kana.<verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Mu kuulu, bandughu mu kana, be beme liinama mabwunu ma Nzaami mama mu Yiisu-Kriste ma mali ku Yude. Behe si liigyagha kundaa baara ba nsie a beme ba baagwene okasa kana mu Yiisu, mpara oyo yi oogyagha banga-a-kana baba ku Yude kundaa baara ba nsie a bomo. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Me bo baadzwi Mfumu Yiisu ya mibighili, me bo baamwehẽ bihi kimini. Bo ka baakagwa Nzaami esee o ya bo bali mitaara mi baara bwohono. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Bo baakakahaba bihi mu oluo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o maluo ma maabvwuhu bo. Obo me bu baakakwuhu eteese ki masumu ma bo matala mwohono. Lo nkehe a Nzaami yiibwi mu bo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole li a nzala a ofirimono basi Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Lo mu bihi, bandughu mu kana, bihi lili la ya be mu manyuru mu mana matala, lo ka mu mukolo o. Mu matala ma, bihi lili a nzala a oyamono be yi alagha, ya bihi lili mu okasa mpini mpaala ndagha oyo yikughu. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Mansa malagha, bihi liikasagha oyamono be, ya meme Poole aangyeele ogya kundaa be, lo Satana aakakahaba bihi. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Mu obo, nande li emiini e bihi? Nande li esee e bihi? Nande li kagha lili mutwunu a bihi? Ka ngu behe si ŋa nkulu a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu, mu matala ma akala aagya nde o? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Mu engaŋma, me be lili nsia a bihi ya esee e bihi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Me mu obo, buulu bihi ka liifirileene okebe o, bihi liigwolo munkaana wu osyili ngasighi ku bvulu lili Atene. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ya bihi liigweghe be Timote, wu li ndughu a bihi mu kana, wu aakasala ya Nzaami mu okatsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Kriste emõ ya bihi, mpaala nde agwa be mpini ya bukyini mu osa mukama mu kana. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Mpaala mbwuru anyaã okala a mukolo maã-maã mu nkooro a kimini li lili mu okamono bihi-a-be matala ma. Buulu, be ligyighili osoolo beme ti mpara oyo yili kunsa bitsimi bi ókuru Nzaami mu bihi-a-be. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Mu matala ma líli bihi kundaa be, bihi líitswama okalyele be ti sa bamwehẽ bihi-a-be kimini li lilagha. Ya be lisoolo ti mandagha mamo maakeele. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Me mu obo, me ka aafirindeene okebe o ya me aangweghe Timote mu oyabagha mansia ma kana li be, bu limono nzala a mweẽ ti nkini a nki Nga-a-bigyeele maagyeele be, ya mara esala e bihi ekala kii bwunu.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Lo mu matala ma, Timote wu fi kundaa be, maayabvughuru kundaa bihi, ya nde aayagwa bihi mansia ma mabwe mama kana li be, mama dzyi li be. Nde aalyele bihi bitsimi bi bibwe bi liikebe be mu bihi ya ti be lili a nkara a nzala a ofirimono bihi, ti bwunu a bu lili a bihi si nkara a nzala a ofirimono be. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Mu obo, bandughu mu kana, ŋa kara a mpara ya kimini li bihi, bihi liibagha bukyini mu be, mu nkooro a kana li be. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Mu matala ma, bihi liifiribagha bumweẽ, mu kuulu be lili mu okasa mukama mu Mfumu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Bunu-abo bihi likughu obvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami mu nkooro a be, mu esee kyehene ki lili a bihi mu be ŋa nkulu a Nzaami a bihi? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Mpyibi ya mwi, bihi liikabuono Nzaami ku olagha mpaala bihi lifirimono be ya libwehe mandagha ma mali mu okagweene mu kana li be.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nyaã Nzaami ndeme wu li Taara a bihi-a-be, ya Mfumu a bihi-a-be Yiisu, badzubulu bihi nzili yi ogya kundaa be! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nyaã Mfumu asa kuulu ti dzyi li be lilwulu ya lipfini ŋa kara li be ya babake ya baara bwohono, ti bu oli dzyi li bihi mu be! <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Nyaã nde agwa mikolo mi be mpini mpaala be likala baara baba bungili, gwene a epfwumu ki baasyeme ŋa nkulu a Nzaami wu li Taara a bihi, mu matala ma oogya Mfumu a bihi Yiisu ya baba ngili ba nde bwohono! Aamene!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nzya-nzyara yi aakagwa Nzaami esee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Bandughu mu kana, mu omana, bihi liigyihi be nki nzya-nzyara be lifaana okala a yo mu ogwa Nzaami esee, ya be lili mu okadzyara obo. Lo mu matala ma, bihi lili mu okaluomo be ya lili mu okatumu be mu nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu mu ofirigyighili mi miluru. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Mu kuulu, be lisoolo nki maluo bihi liigwi be ma maafi kundaa Mfumu Yiisu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Dzyi li Nzaami lili ti be likala baara ba bátwulu mu libee mu okala ba baba ndaa nde, linyaã okala a enkwunu. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Nyaã nswe mbwuru mu be agyighili osuolo mukala a nde mu okala kunsa bungili ya budziri. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Nde ka faana onama bisee bi musunu o ti bu ookasa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mu ndagha yi, mbwuru si mumõ anyaã osa bubi bwunu we opfiri ndughu a nde mu kana, mu kuulu bihi liitswama olyele be yo ya osuo bumpughulu bu ndagha yi: Mfumu aakasyeme baara ba baakagyighili mandagha mamo. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Mu kuulu, Nzaami ka aati bihi mbili mpaala bihi likakala kunsa mandagha mama osuŋumu o, lo mu okakala kunsa bungili. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Me mu obo, nswe munde wu aabihi maluo ma, nde ka mbwuru abihi o, lo nde Nzaami wu aakagwa be Mufulu a nde wu a Ngili abihi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Mu mi mitala dzyi lili bandughu mu kana, be ka lili a nzala a kuulu ti basono be mukaana o, mu kuulu Nzaami aaluo be bunu be lifaana okadzyi babake be a be. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Me obo behe si liikasa kundaa bandughu mu kana bwohono ba bali ku nsie yi a Masedwane yohono. Lo bandughu ba me mu kana, bihi ligwi be mpama mu ofirigye linku-nkulu. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Liikasagha okala kunsa edzuunu, mu okatala yini a mandagha ma beme, ya mu okasala mu myaã mi be, ti bu liigwi bihi be litumu. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Mpaala nzya-nzyara a be yikala yi a budziri ŋa mihi mi baara baala ka bali banga-a-kana o, ya be linyaã okala leme kundaa mbwuru mukimi.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osighili o banga-a-kana mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Bandughu mu kana, bihi ka lidzyi o ti be likala kunsa nzi-nzimini mu mi mitala baara ba bákpi, mpaala be linyaã okala kunsa minyoõ ti anga baara babake ba bagwene a emiini. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Mu kuulu, kala ti bihi liikasa kana ti Yiisu aakpi ya aasighili mu lipfu, bwunu obo si Nzaami akala aasiili mu Yiisu, emõ ya nde baara ba bákpi. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ligyughu ndagha yi lilyele bihi be, yo yili ndagha yi ólyele Mfumu: Bihi-a-be ba liikala mweẽ tee mu matala ma oogya Mfumu, ka akala liikala ku nkulu a babo ba bátswama okpa o. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Mu kuulu Mfumu ndeme, mu engubu kii litumu, ya mu likyi li mfumu a bangye-yulu ya lili mvulu-a-mvulu a Nzaami, bu aafa ku yulu, sa ayakumunu ya ba bákpi mu Kriste sa batswama osighili mu lipfu. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ŋa nseele, bihi-a-be ba lili nkini mweẽ, sa baseene bihi-a-be nzili mõ ya bo mu bidzi mu obwana a Mfumu, mu engye-a-ngye. Ya obo me bu liikala bihi-a-be matala mwohono ya Mfumu. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Mu obo, mu mandagha mamo liikagwa be a be bukyini.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okebe etsughu ki oogya Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Bandughu mu kana, mu mi mitala matala bwunu we ena ki ookeele mandagha mamo, be ka lili a nzala a kuulu ti basono be mo o. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Mu kuulu, be beme ligyighili osoolo ti etsughu e Mfumu sa egya ti anga bu ookagya muturu mu mpyibi. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Mu matala ma akala oolyele baara ti: «Bihi lili mu edzuunu ya lili kunsa nke-nkebe yimbwe!» Oŋo mu ensihibi obyihi sa obwa mu bo ti anga misuo mi oburu, ya ka okala a mbwuru wu akala aabara o. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Lo be bandughu mu kana, be ka lili kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa o, mu kuulu etsughu ekye egya kundaa be mu ensihibi ti anga muturu. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mu kuulu be bwohono lili baana ba otsyeme, baana ba mwiĩ. Bihi-a-be ka lili baara baba mpyibi o, bwunu we baara baba mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa o. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Mu obo, bihi-a-be linyaã ogyoŋomo ensama ti anga baara babake. Lo litswe likahala mihi ya likala a nzya-nzyara yi faana ya yi budziri.<verse eid="1TH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Mu kuulu, baara ba baakagyoŋomo, mu mpyibi baakagyoŋomo ensama, ya baara ba baakakolo mala, mu mpyibi baakakolo mala. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Lo bihi-a-be ba lili baara ba mwiĩ, litswe likala a nzya-nzyara yi faana ya yi budziri, litswe lilaha kana ya dzyi ti anga enkuru kii mu esyeẽ ki baakakyi butulu, ya emiini kii obvwughu ti anga mpu yi esyeẽ. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Mu kuulu, Nzaami ka ásuolo bihi-a-be mu ogyagha nkehe a masyeme ma nde o, lo mu obagha obvwughu mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />wu aakpi mu nkooro a bihi mpaala, ngu okala ti bihi-a-be lili mu okakahala mihi, bwunu we lili mu okagyoŋomo ensama, bihi-a-be likala emõ ya nde. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Mu obo, liikagwa be a be mpini ya liikabaha bana mu okulu mu kana, ti bwunu a bu liitswama okasa be.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikele ya liseme bibi masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Bandughu mu kana, bihi liluomo be mu okala a budziri mu baara baala ŋa kara li be bali mu okasala mu be, ba bali mu okatumu be mu Mfumu ya ba bali mu okagyehe be. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Liikagwa bo budziri bu bulagha ya liikadzyi bo mu nkooro a bigyighili bi bo. Liikakala mu edzuunu be a be.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Bandughu mu kana, bihi ligwi be mpama mu okagyehe babolo, mu okagwa banga a nzalamweẽ bukyini, mu okabaha ba bakolo. Liikakala a mukolo wu munene kundaa baara bwohono. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Liikasa mayele, mbwuru si mumõ anyaã obvurulu bubi mu bubi, lo matala mwohono, liikasagha osa bubwe be a be ya kundaa baara bwohono.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Liikakala mu esee matala mwohono.<verse eid="1TH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Liikabuono matala mwohono.<verse eid="1TH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Liikabvurulu matuono mu mandagha mwohono, mu kuulu lilo me waa li Nzaami kundaa be mu Kriste Yiisu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ka lidzihibi mbaa a Mufulu a Ngili o,<verse eid="1TH 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />ka likatsaala mandagha ma ookalyele mibighili o,<verse eid="1TH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ligyighili okakeene mandagha mwohono, liikakebe mandagha ma mabwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Liikabihi osa bubi mu bifa byehene.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nyaã Nzaami wu edzuunu ndeme asa be baba ngili kuu mukughu. Nyaã ti embwuru e be kyehene, mufulu a be, muwumunu a be, nyuru a be, bikala bi bákebe bubwe bi bigwene a yi baasyeme tee mu matala ma oogya Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste! <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Mbwuru wu aati be mbili, li wu bakughu osa kana mu nde: Nde aasa ndagha oyo.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Bandughu mu kana, liikabuono si mu bihi.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ligwa bandughu mu kana bwohono mamboro mu onyuburu ku ofaana ya kuu baana ba Nzaami. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Me mbuono be mu nkwumu a Mfumu: Litaã mukaana wu ŋa nkulu a bandughu mu kana bwohono!<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nyaã bwehe bu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste bukala ya be!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>